    <description>ARC helper functions for Common workflow language.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Additions:
merge persons with and without orcid when writing ro-crate
add test against merging of same name persons
small safeguard to stop writers failing on existing .gitkeep
Bugfixes:
start working on some Author-related RO-Crate conversion fixes</releaseNotes>
